1. Validate LCDM against official DESI DR2 BAO public chains.
2. Validate LCDM + Pantheon+ and LCDM + DESY5.
3. Turn on the custom scalar theory with V1 fixed to 0; verify it reproduces LCDM-like distances.
4. Release V1 and run BAO only.
5. Run BAO + Pantheon+.
6. Run BAO + DESY5.
7. Add compressed CMB.
8. Compare:
   - posterior P(V1 > 0)
   - best-fit Delta chi2 vs LCDM
   - reconstructed w_phi(z)
   - whether the model stays in w >= -1
